SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

This licence covers the code, configurations, protocol documents, manifests,
analysis outputs and per-sample prediction files produced by the authors.

It does NOT cover the underlying corpora. No corpus text is redistributed in
this package. GoEmotions and the pinned SuperTweetEval TweetEmotion
redistribution remain under the terms of their own sources, and anyone
rebuilding the corpus must obtain those sources directly and observe their
terms.
